    "norm": "Verifies that when substitution inside values is disabled, variable references embedded in map values are treated as literal strings and are NOT recursively resolved. For example, if \"animal\" maps to \"${critter}\", the result keeps \"${critter}\" verbatim rather than following the chain to \"quick brown fox\"."
